    {
      "Id": 2006901005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "叶羽，现在方便吗？我要进来了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊，妈妈。怎么，给我送零食？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010050",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是……今天是想和你商量件事。/n马上就是“儿童节”了吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我在想，你有没有什么想去的地方。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈啊？儿童节……？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010080",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "怎么可能有嘛～～～。/n人多的地方又累，在家打游戏才最好。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010090",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 79,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 27,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这才是最棒的休假方式吧～。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "唉……还是老样子啊。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "话说回来，妈妈居然主动提这种事，还挺少见的。/n怎么了，发生什么事了？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这次的工作协调好了，应该能腾出时间。/n难得有机会，我想一家人一起过。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而且，现在的叶羽……在剧团电姬真的很努力。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "欸，你知道？话说，你看过我的演出！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "当然，那可是女儿的重要舞台。/n演得很好哦。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那、那当然啦？有我出马不是理所当然嘛！/n而且伊吕波她们也都干劲十足！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呵呵，是这样啊。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我和爸爸商量过，想给叶羽庆祝一下。",
      "BgmFileName": "8",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而且以前你不是忙着童星的工作，还有奥林匹斯那边的事吗？/n一直没能给你腾出时间，让全家人一起慢慢出去玩。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010210",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以我就想，现在再补上也可以吧……之类的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 40501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过我不会勉强你。/n毕竟是难得的儿童节。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "如果叶羽想在家打游戏，/n我觉得那样也很好。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006901027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006901,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……嘛，既然妈妈都说到这个份上了，/n要我考虑一下，也不是不行。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069010260",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
